Coverage limits
---------------
The Live Migration test moves VM2 to VM3, so it does not invoke the VM1-owned PCI edu IRQ teardown path. The run confirms general IRQ migration and source VM reclamation, but does not prove edu function reset, VM1 teardown, device reuse, DMA quiescence, or LPI affinity migration. These are not reported as runtime-verified.
